  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added direct drawing on SpatialRaster<RGBA8BitColor>: curve and contour strokes, dashed segments, circle and rectangle fills, arrows with optional dashed shafts, and coordinate grids with labels. Added cached TrueType glyph sets and a built-in 5x7 pixel font with lowercase Latin and Russian letters. Added Darken and Lighten in sRGB, linear RGB, and OKLCH. Optimized curve coverage using bounds and tile culling. Existing 1.4.0 APIs are retained. Targets remain netstandard2.1 and net6.0.",
